{"id":"38617","texts":[{"kind":"transcription","label":"תעתיק","editor":"umrethwala","citation":"Yusuf Umrethwala, PGP Transcriptions‎ (in Arabic) (n.p., 2023).","html":"<section dir=\"rtl\" lang=\"ar\"> <div data-canvas=\"https://luna.manchester.ac.uk/luna/servlet/iiif/m/ManchesterDev~95~2~40670~106104/canvas/c1\"> <h3>Recto</h3> <ol>\n<li>الحمد لله وصلى الله على] سيدنا محمد نبيه واله وسلم</li>\n<li>وحسبنا ا]لله [ونعم الـو]كيل</li>\n</ol> </div> </section>"}]}